{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Internal admin-only contained DAV tree writer used by files.dav for recursive DELETE and overwrite-aware COPY/MOVE. Resolves both source and destination through resolve_path, rejects roots, equivalent/containing source-destination pairs, missing parents, and symlinks anywhere in either tree or ancestry. COPY stages a complete tree before replacement; MOVE stages by same-filesystem rename; Overwrite F returns 412 and T preserves a backup until commit. Returns code-prefixed structured errors (400/403/404/409/412/500) for the DAV adapter. This is not an anonymous file API and does not implement LOCK/UNLOCK.","import":"use crate::files::files::resolve_path::resolve_path;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::unique_session_id::unique_session_id;\nuse std::fs;\nuse std::path::{Path, PathBuf};","params":[{"desc":"Exactly DELETE, COPY, or MOVE.","name":"operation","type":"String"},{"desc":"Contained share-relative source path.","name":"source","type":"String"},{"desc":"Contained share-relative destination for COPY/MOVE; empty for DELETE.","name":"destination","type":"String"},{"desc":"WebDAV Overwrite value, exactly T or F; ignored for DELETE.","name":"overwrite","type":"String"}],"returntype":"JSONObject","type":"rust"},"id":"uzhykj1a1b0eade9fg63f","readers":[],"time":1793970922537,"username":"system","writers":[]}